  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call back the energies of spells you have cast.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Recapture Energy<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat as a swift action. If you have cast more than one spell since the beginning of your last turn, you can use this feat to recapture the energy of each spell as part of the same swift action, paying the ki point cost separately for each.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
